## SQ-BREED-04 | the tags nesting the flower tags keep the removed entries; the flower tags stay without them
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag item minecraft:flowers`; `/cdevtest tag item creativecompat:physics/floats`; `/cdevtest tag item another_furniture:planter_box_placeables`; `/cdevtest tag item creativecompat:flower_box_plants`; `/cdevtest tag block creativeworldgen:ground_match/plants`; `/cdevtest tag block creativeworldgen:template_trim/plants`; `/cdevtest tag block chalk:chalk_cannot_draw_on`
@pass `minecraft:flowers` items: no `wild_` id, no flower crown or leaf pile; physics/floats: wild plants, `botania:` special flowers, the flower crown and both azalea leaf piles; planter_box_placeables and flower_box_plants: the small-flower wild plants (for example `rusticdelight:wild_cotton` if it was a small flower); ground_match/plants, template_trim/plants and chalk_cannot_draw_on: the wild crop blocks (Farmer's Delight, Corn, Delightful, Miner's, Rustic)
@fails `animal_tags.js` `keep(...)` runs after `t.remove` or a tag owner script replaces the tag later (priority)
> cdevtest tag item minecraft:flowers
> cdevtest tag item creativecompat:physics/floats
> cdevtest tag item another_furniture:planter_box_placeables
> cdevtest tag item creativecompat:flower_box_plants
> cdevtest tag block creativeworldgen:ground_match/plants
> cdevtest tag block creativeworldgen:template_trim/plants
> cdevtest tag block chalk:chalk_cannot_draw_on
reject verb=tag kind=item tag=minecraft:flowers .*ids=.*\b[a-z_]+:wild_
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecompat:physics/floats .*ids=(?=.*\b[a-z_]+:wild_)(?=.*flower_crown)(?=.*botania:)
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=another_furniture:planter_box_placeables .*ids=.*\b[a-z_]+:wild_
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativecompat:flower_box_plants .*ids=.*\b[a-z_]+:wild_
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativeworldgen:ground_match/plants .*ids=.*rusticdelight:wild_
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativeworldgen:template_trim/plants .*ids=.*rusticdelight:wild_
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=chalk:chalk_cannot_draw_on .*ids=.*\b[a-z_]+:wild_
look counts close to the 2026-11-10 dump (ground_match/plants and template_trim back by about 19 wild crop blocks, physics/floats by about 78, flower_box_plants by the small-flower wild plants)
